<!--
  BUILD NOTE (2026-07-06, M1): the cow beat is the first PinScene — a scroll-scrubbed,
  reversible GSAP timeline (ADR-013). Captions are the only visible text; the old prose
  for this section lives in git history. Beat indices refer to CowScene.BEATS.
